First chords tab, for this addicting but simple song :D

The confusing part about this song's chords is that the progression goes C-Am-Em-
F, in two different directions at different times. So for bass, I'll label it Bass1 and Bass2.
The arpeggio usually follows the second. The chords otherwise match with each other.

Bass1 chords: C-Am-Em-F (Each chord lower than one before)
Synth Arpeggio, Bass2 chords: C-A-E-F (Go down from C-A  then go up to E then F)
Synth Solo notes: E-C-E-C-G-C-E-C/E-C-E-C-A-C-E-C
